	(text "PCB PLACEMENT NOTES:\n- C5 (1uF) at U3 IN pin; C6 (2.2uF) at U3 OUT pin.\n- C7 (1uF) at U11 VIN pin; C8 (10uF) at U11 VOUT pin.\n- Keep each cap within ~2mm of its pin, GND side straight to a via."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 180.34 0)
